sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Elder as Elderly User
    participant UI as Chat Screen
    participant ChatMgr as Chat Service
    participant AI as OpenRouter AI API
    participant DB as Appwrite DB (Chat History)

    Elder->>UI: Open Chat Tab
    UI->>DB: listChatSessionsForUser(userId)
    DB-->>UI: List of ChatSessions
    UI->>Elder: Render History & Input
    
    Elder->>UI: Type message and click Send
    UI->>UI: Add immediate optimistic user message
    
    UI->>AI: POST /api/v1/chat/completions (model, messages[])
    activate AI
    
    loop Stream Response
        AI-->>UI: Chunk of text data
        UI->>UI: Update Assistant message state
    end
    
    AI-->>UI: Stream Complete
    deactivate AI
    
    Note right of UI: Save conversation to DB
    
    UI->>ChatMgr: updateChatSession(chatId, newMessages)
    alt New Session
        ChatMgr->>DB: createChatSession(...)
    else Existing Session
        ChatMgr->>DB: updateRow(chatId, messages)
    end
    DB-->>ChatMgr: Success
    ChatMgr-->>UI: Saved
